# Buddhist Vocabulary Translation Review System
Last updated: 2026-05-04 (update 10)

## Purpose

A collaborative web app for a team translating Chinese Buddhist texts into English.
When a translator encounters a Buddhist term, they add it to the app. Claude AI
automatically generates Pinyin, Pali, Sanskrit equivalents, and three English
translation options. Team members then vote on the best translation. A leader or
admin finalizes the winning choices (First and Second).

