## User Roles

Access is controlled dynamically via the **Members** Google Sheet. Role is resolved
at login and stored in session.

**Member:**
- View all terms in sortable/searchable table
- Open Edit View for any term
- Vote on any of 6 translation options per term; change vote at any time
- Edit unlocked translation fields (locked once a field receives any vote)
- Add new terms (single form or bulk CSV)
- View team list (read-only)

**Leader:**
- All member capabilities
- Set Final (First) and Final (Second) translations for any term
- Reset finalization (↺ Final Reset)

**Admin:**
- All leader capabilities
- Manage team members: add, edit (Name/ShortName/Role), remove via ☷ Team modal
- Manage sources via ⊕ Sources modal
- Initialize Google Sheets headers (first-run or schema migration)

`SUPER_ADMIN_EMAIL` env var (defaults to vlin77@gmail.com) always has admin access
regardless of the Members sheet, serving as a bootstrap fallback.

