## Translation Fields

Each term supports six votable translation options:

| Field             | Label           | Editable | Votable | Notes                          |
|-------------------|-----------------|----------|---------|--------------------------------|
| Translation1      | AI Translate 1  | Yes      | Yes     | AI-generated                   |
| Translation2      | AI Translate 2  | Yes      | Yes     | AI-generated                   |
| Translation3      | AI Translate 3  | Yes      | Yes     | AI-generated                   |
| TranslationKnown  | Known           | Yes      | Yes     | Existing known translation     |
| TranslationOther1 | Suggested 1     | Yes      | Yes     | Member-proposed alternative    |
| TranslationOther2 | Suggested 2     | Yes      | Yes     | Member-proposed alternative    |

**Locking rule:** Any translation field with ≥1 vote becomes read-only (enforced in
both backend and frontend).

**Auto-selection:** TranslationFirst and TranslationSecond are recalculated after
every vote on pending terms. A field qualifies only if it has >1 vote; ties go to the
higher-ranked option. Written back to the Terms sheet automatically.

**Manual finalization:** Leaders/admins can override auto-selection by setting Final
(First) and Final (Second) explicitly. Finalized terms store actual translation text
in TranslationFirst/Second (not vote keys). `recalculate_auto_selections()` skips
finalized terms to preserve manual choices.

