## UI Layout

**Header:**
- Branding: T-CAT (bold) / Buddhist Vocabulary (subtitle)
- Right: user name, role badge, Sign out

**List View (main):**
- Sortable table: Term (Chinese + ID), Romanization, First Choice, Second Choice,
  Status, Source, Added date, Total votes, Edit button
- Sort by: Chinese, Pinyin, or Timestamp (default: latest first)
- Filter sidebar: All / Pending / Finalized / Not Yet Voted (labels bold and dark)
- Search: splits query on spaces; all words must appear across Chinese, Pinyin,
  all 6 translation texts, and source name
- Pagination: default 20 per page; page size selector (20/50/100); Prev/Next buttons;
  "Page X of Y · N–M of Total" indicator; controls rendered above and below the table.
  Search/filter/sort all operate over the full in-memory dataset before slicing.
  Changing search, filter, sort, or page size resets to page 1.

**Edit View (per-term):**
- Header (left): Chinese term, Pinyin (inline editable), Pali/Sanskrit tags, status badge,
  Created/Modified metadata line
- Header (right): ← Back to list button + Source dropdown stacked below it
- Translation box top row: AI Translate 1 | AI Translate 2 | AI Translate 3
- Translation box bottom row: Known Translation | Suggested 1 | Suggested 2
- Each panel: label, inline editable textarea (locked if voted), vote count, Vote button;
  Final 1st / Final 2nd badges on winning panels
- Autopicks bar: shows computed First/Second choice or finalized text; ✦ AI Translate
  button appears when any of AI Translate 1–3 is empty
- Below box (2-col grid): Source Content Chinese | Source Content English (side by side),
  then Notes (full width)
- Set Final (First) row: visible to leader/admin; 6 option buttons
- Set Final (Second) row: visible after First is set; 6 option buttons
- ↺ Final Reset button: visible to leader/admin when finalization exists
- Editing History table: timestamped audit log, newest first

**Design aesthetic:** Dark ink header (#1a1208), gold accents (#c9a84c), warm paper
background (#f5f0e8). T-CAT in Cormorant Garamond bold gold. Noto Serif TC for Chinese;
Cormorant Garamond + EB Garamond for English.

