## First-Run Setup (new installation)

1. Create a Google Sheet, share it with the service account
2. Set SHEET_ID (and optionally SUPER_ADMIN_EMAIL) in .env
3. Run app, log in as super admin, click "⚙ Init Sheets" — creates all five
   worksheet headers (Terms, Votes, Members, Sources, Audit_Log) and seeds
   super admin in Members sheet
4. Open ⊕ Sources modal to add reference sources
5. Open ☷ Team modal to add team members, set Name/ShortName, assign roles
6. Add terms or bulk import via CSV

## Schema Migration (existing installation)

Run "⚙ Init Sheets" again — it is idempotent:
- Adds missing columns to Terms (up to col 26) without touching existing data
- Renames LastModifiedDate → LastModifiedTime if found
- Adds Name/ShortName columns to Members if missing
- Creates Sources worksheet if missing
- Creates Audit_Log worksheet if missing
- Backfills RomanizationPlain for existing rows where Pinyin is set but plain is blank
- Rewrites old short Term IDs (T001) to 6-digit format (T000001) in Terms and Votes sheets

